Version: 1.0
desc: Dr. Nine Drum Synthesizer (9W9 port) by chmaha
tags: instrument
author: chmaha
changelog:
  Initial release.
about:
  TR-909 style drum machine: circuit-modelled kick, snare, toms, rim shot and hand clap,
  sampled hi-hats, ride and crash, per-voice drive, distortion, pan and reverb/delay sends,
  master distortion and glue compressor, stereo or 11-channel multi-out (one output per voice as on
  the TR-909's back panel, hi-hats shared, plus an FX return; pan, master distortion and compressor are stereo only),
  ported from 9W9 by athousanddetails, after ER-99 by Matthew Cieplak
  https://github.com/athousanddetails/schwung-9W9 (GPLv3)
  JSFX version released under GPLv3+ license
  Claude generated some of this code
provides:
  Dependencies/DrNine/DrNineHiHat.flac
  Dependencies/DrNine/DrNineRide.flac
  Dependencies/DrNine/DrNineCrash.flac

